        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Years ago, Dan Drake was just a cook at a small restaurant in the USA. Now, he is a famous pancake artist."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Dan has always been good at drawing. In high school, he loved to draw "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "comics",
            "zh": "漫画"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". He wanted to be a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "musician",
            "ref": "v-musician"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " when he grew up. He needed money for his "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "dream",
            "ref": "v-dream"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". So, he found a job as a cook."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "One day, someone came to buy a pancake. He "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "seemed",
            "zh": "似乎"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to be having a bad day. Dan made the best "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "smiley",
            "zh": "微笑的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " face pancake he could. He got a $15 "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "tip",
            "ref": "v-tip"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "After that, Dan began to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "practise",
            "ref": "v-practise"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " pancake art. Now he is really good at it. He has also started his pancake art "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "company",
            "ref": "v-company"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "! It is called “Dancakes”."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
